  "_comment": [
    "Bundled app catalog. Schema: docs/standalone.md#catalog-format.",
    "Every entry resolves to the publisher's OWN GitHub releases, verified to have APK assets.",
    "Nothing points at upstream AAAD's Firebase bucket.",
    "",
    "The rest of the mirroring family (Screen2Auto, AAMirror, AAStream, AA Mirror Plus) is still",
    "absent: none of them publishes an APK release. slashmax/AAMirror is source-only, Screen2Auto",
    "ships from inceptive.ru, and upstream AAAD hosts pre-renamed builds signed with the public",
    "AOSP test key. See TASKS.md T-15. Do not add them with invented URLs."
  ],
